OL,3,AMoments of silence mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FVice-President JD Vance, former New
OL,8,FYork Mayor Rudy Giuliani and former
OL,9,FPresidents Joe Biden and Barack Obama
OL,10,Fare all attending the commemoration -
OL,11,Fhere's a look at how the attacks are
OL,12,Fbeing remembered throughout the day
OL,14,FOn 11 September 2001, 2,977 people were
OL,15,Fkilled when hijackers crashed two
OL,16,Fplanes into the Twin Towers of the
OL,17,FWorld Trade Center
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
